---
// biome-ignore lint/correctness/noUnusedImports: Astro uses this layout component below.
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Docs | plansplease"
  description="Short guides for the plansplease CLI and private cloud workspace."
  activePath="docs"
>
  <section class="page-heading" aria-labelledby="docs-title">
    <div>
      <h1 id="docs-title">Docs for a small tool.</h1>
      <p>
        Everything you need to run, inspect, and vault agent-generated web artifacts. Preview
        pages locally with zero latency, or preserve them forever in your secure cloud workspace.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="page-action" href="../cli/">Start with the CLI</a>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="docs-list-title">
    <h2 id=\"docs-list-title\">Start here.</h2>

    <div class="docs-grid">
      <article class="doc-card">
        <h3>1. Install the CLI</h3>
        <p>
          Install the command globally via npm. It gives any standalone HTML file or directory an
          instant local loopback URL.
        </p>
        <div class="code-pill">
          <code>npm install --global @abijith-suresh/planview</code>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="doc-card">
        <h3>2. Publish a local page</h3>
        <p>
          Publish a file or page folder. The background daemon creates a lightweight local snapshot
          and automatically opens your browser.
        </p>
        <div class="code-pill">
          <code>planview publish --open ./page.html</code>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="doc-card">
        <h3>3. Save a cloud copy</h3>
        <p>
          Sign in to the plansplease workspace and upload your HTML file. Your tools and dashboards
          stay permanently accessible from any browser.
        </p>
        <div class="meta-tag-pill">
          <span>Private cloud workspace • GitHub sign-in</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Guides Breakdown -->
    <div class="docs-guides">
      <h3 class="guides-heading">Core Guides</h3>
      <div class="guides-grid">
        <a class="guide-item" href="../cli/">
          <h4>CLI Reference & Options</h4>
          <p>Learn how to use <code>publish</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>start</code>, and daemon management.</p>
          <span class="guide-link-text">Read CLI guide</span>
        </a>

        <a class="guide-item" href="../features/">
          <h4>Architecture & Web Standards</h4>
          <p>Understand how loopback isolation, single-file HTML, and multi-asset bundles work.</p>
          <span class="guide-link-text">Explore features</span>
        </a>

        <a class="guide-item" href="../faq/">
          <h4>Frequently Asked Questions</h4>
          <p>Common questions regarding security, CORS policies, limits, and team workflows.</p>
          <span class="guide-link-text">View FAQ</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="page-note">
      Detailed API endpoints and self-hosting documentation will be added as the platform evolves.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .docs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .doc-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--night-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--night-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .doc-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .doc-card p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--night-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .code-pill {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--night);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-border);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .code-pill code {
    color: var(--mint);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .meta-tag-pill {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--night);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-border);
    color: var(--night-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .docs-guides {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--night-border);
  }

  .guides-heading {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .guides-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .guide-item {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--night-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--night-card);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 160ms ease;
  }

  .guide-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--night-border-hover);
  }

  .guide-item h4 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .guide-item p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--night-muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .guide-item code {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--night);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-border);
    color: var(--mint);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .guide-link-text {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--mint);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .docs-grid,
    .guides-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
